BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 760 Tm (Saltmarsh Historical Society - Minutes of the January Meeting) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 728 Tm (Mrs. Edith Marlow chaired the meeting in the reading room on a cold Tuesday.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 712 Tm (Mrs. Marlow has been a member of the Saltmarsh Historical Society since 1931.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 696 Tm (Harold Marlow, brother of Mrs. Marlow, attended as a guest and took no vote.) Tj ET
