BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 648 Tm (Miss Nella Brightwater, librarian at the Lantern Street Library, brought) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 632 Tm (the minute books for the years 1920 to 1925.) Tj ET
